  </bottom_margin>
  <main_text>
    <l n="1" para="true">1159. Balduinus multas civitates ejec-</l>
    <l n="2">tis Sarracenis in pacem &amp; libertatem</l>
    <l n="3">restituit.</l>
    <l n="4" para="true">1164. Moritur Balduinus Hierosoly-</l>
    <l n="5">mitanus Rex,subrogatusque est frater ejus</l>
    <l n="6">Almericus, sextus Rex.</l>
    <l n="7" para="true">1170. Almericus in Ægypto clara po-</l>
    <l n="8">titur victoria.</l>
    <l n="9" para="true">
      <i>Ægypti Chalifa ultimus tum erat</i>
    </l>
    <l n="10">Elhadech Etzarledin, <i>filius</i> Elphais, <i>quo</i>
    </l>
    <l n="11">
      <i>occiso</i> Salahadinus <i>ille famosus, abrogato</i>
    </l>
    <l n="12">
      <i>Chalifatu Fatimidarum, Sultanus sive</i>
    </l>
    <l n="13">
      <i>Imperator Ægypti &amp; Syriæ factus est, qui</i>
    </l>
    <l n="14">
      <i>genus suum ab</i> Ajobo <i>sive</i> Jobo <i>Patiente,</i>
    </l>
    <l n="15">
      <i>derivabat. Vnde illa familia Sultanorum</i>
    </l>
    <l n="16">
      <i>Ægypti erat</i> Ajobitarum, <i>quibus successe-</i>
    </l>
    <l n="17">
      <i>runt</i> Turcomanni <i>&amp; hi</i> Circassi Mama-</l>
    <l n="18">lucci.</l>
    <l n="19" para="true">1171. Idem Rex Damiatam obsedit:</l>
    <l n="20">sed malis conditionibus init pacem.</l>
    <l n="21" para="true">1172. Sarraceni Africani plurimas fe-</l>
    <l n="22">cerunt excursiones in Hispaniam.</l>
    <l n="23" para="true">1175. Almericus Hierusalem Rex fe-</l>
    <l n="24">bri extinctus: Balduinus filius ejus in Re-</l>
    <l n="25">gem ungitur, septimus Rex.</l>
    <l n="26" para="true">1177. Balduinus Saladini Ægyptiorum</l>
    <l n="27">Regis copiis bis victis &amp; deletis, multum</l>
    <l n="28">auri Hierosolymis intulit.</l>
    <l n="29" para="true">1180. Filia Regis Sarracenorum, quæ</l>
    <l n="30">Pagano principi nupserat, à Rege Siciliæ</l>
  </main_text>
